-- SAH-53 (ADR-020 D3) · Seed: the EMR section library, generated from the EMR mockup
-- docs/design/mockup/EMR-Configuration-Smart-Clinic.html (window.__DC_SRC, screen Main: constants FALLBACK and S).
-- STARTER LIST, NOT CLINICALLY REVIEWED (OQ-43-8, OQ-45-1). Every section name, description, field label, type, hint
-- (meta), required flag and option list is a value from the EMR mockup, accepted by the human in DEC-039, not clinically
-- reviewed. A clinician must review them before real use.
-- 100 sections (COMMON 14, SPECIALTY 78, COMPLIANCE 8), 313 fields, 136 options. Reference data only; no patient data.
--
-- How the mockup text became rows (ADR-020 D3):
--   * field_key is the label in lower case with every run of other characters made one underscore ("BP systolic" -> bp_systolic).
--   * A section with no field list in the mockup gets the mockup FALLBACK: Findings (Rich text), Template (Dropdown), Attachments (File).
--   * Options: only a complete list in the hint becomes options (for example "Mild / Moderate / Severe"). A hint that ends with
--     an ellipsis, names a source ("By region", "Vendor list", "Per eye") or is a range with no members is not a list: no options,
--     free text allowed. A numeric or roman range is spelled out (Grade 0-3, Oxford 0-5, ECOG 0-4, ASA I-IV, Grade 1/2/3).
--     "Before / after food" is spelled out as Before food and After food; "Class I / II / III" as Class I, II, III.
--     Option keys: the label as a key; a label that starts with a digit gets the prefix "o" (o0, o100).
--   * Required multi-select and checklist fields with options get one "None" option (SAH-53-1, OQ-43-19): modalities.Modality, sx_fitness.Pre-op tests.
--     Required choice fields with options and no None (a scale, a setting or the outcome of an assessment):
--     dental_chart.Numbering, pain.Scale, mmt.Grade, onc_ecog.ECOG, onc_regimen.Dose level, sx_fitness.ASA grade, sx_fitness.PAC, sx_plan.Anaesthesia.
--     Required choice fields whose hint is not a complete list have no options (free text): rom.Joint, rom.Movement, mmt.Muscle group, va.Distance VA, lesion_map.Morphology, sx_fitness.Blood thinners, sx_consent.Consent items.
--   * options_source: Search list Complaint -> complaints; Provisional and Final diagnosis -> diagnoses; Lab tests and Radiology ->
--     investigations; Drug -> medicines; every Search list named Procedure -> SERVICES; the Advice chips -> advice master;
--     other search lists are free typed (OQ-45-17).
--   * allow_free_text: every Search list, and every choice field that has no fixed options.
--   * TABLE columns are taken from a hint that lists them (Procedure, year); other tables have no columns (one column "entry").
--   * min_value and max_value are null: no allowed range is drawn for any field.



